        <mxCell id="profiles" value="Suggested deployment profiles&#10;• Minimal local: Open WebUI + LangGraph + Ollama + Qdrant + PostgreSQL&#10;• Declarative local: model-compose.yml + agents + RAG + MCP&#10;• Coding-agent profile: HarnessRouter + Codex + local workspace&#10;• Microsoft enterprise profile: M365 Agents SDK + Azure AI + Teams / Copilot&#10;• Full hybrid enterprise: Open WebUI + LangGraph + model-compose + M365 SDK + MCP + model router" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
